            </note>
            <note corresp="#d22-f4" n="4" xml:id="d22-f4-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d21">Document 21</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d22-f5" n="5" xml:id="d22-f5-content">
                <p>Tab B included a draft PRM and is not
                    published.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d22-f6" n="6" xml:id="d22-f6-content">
                <p>
                    Carter underlined the phrase
                    “understanding between you and Harold” and wrote “ok. Tell Harold” in the
                    right-hand margin.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d22-f7" n="7" xml:id="d22-f7-content">
                <p>
                    Carter checked the “APPROVE Removal of
                    Restriction (as per Brown)” line and wrote “J” at the end of the memorandum.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
